      "id": "sol.amc-12b-2024-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Note that \\(6! = 720 = 8 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 10.\\) Therefore \\[7! \\cdot 6! = 7! \\cdot (8 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 10) = 10!.\\] So \\(10! - 7! \\cdot 6! = 10! - 10! = 0.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
      "hints": [
        "Write \\(7! \\cdot 6!\\) and see whether it can be rebuilt into \\(10!\\)",
        "Since \\(6! = 720 = 8 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 10,\\) we get \\(7! \\cdot 6! = 7! \\cdot 8 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 10 = 10!\\)"
      ],
